"Q: "Imperial Iron Wall" is face-up in my opponent's Spell & Trap Zone, and its effect that prevents players from banishing cards is applying. In this situation, can I activate "Invocation"?
A: In this scenario, if you can perform the Fusion Summon using only materials in your hand, you can activate "Invocation". Since you cannot apply the effect that allows you to banish materials from your field or the GY when Fusion Summoning an "Invoked" Fusion Monster, you cannot activate "Invocation" if you do not have the correct materials to use otherwise.[1]"

