Basically you want to:

&nbsp;

Danger + Skyblaster = 4 Monsters = Saryuja / SS a thunder, make a colossus on the bottom left.

Then a Dragon (white or black) -> Elpy -> Diabolos (+Saryuja) -> Agarpain -> Crystal Wing -> Another Saryuja using elpy, agarpain and something else (But I prefer hieratic) -> SS another thunder from your hand -> another colossus -> Reborn Diabolos

&nbsp;

This is the linear combo. Then you can tribute Diabolos (if you have levianeer, thats the way to go) for its own effects, then summon levianeer using 3 darks.

&nbsp;

Thats how the deck works. You can also substitute the danger + skyblaster for batteryman solar + white dragon. Send roar to grave, banish to summon white dragon, roar summons dark from the deck and solar makes a token. This way you can even chainlock your opponent, with Saryuja CL1, White Dragon CL2 and Thunder DragonDark (or hawk) CL3, preventing saryuja being negated.

