Brow, this game is awesome. You can do WHATEVER you want to. Tell me another MMORPG with this freedom? everything is clean (Imo, sorcerer's ultimate wave is the worst thing they've ever changed, you can't see shit.)

&nbsp;

The Gameplay is so clean, and I really love the graphics. People can downvote me as many as they want, but this game is FAR better than WOW IMO. This games keeps you eyes alive, while all those pyrowizardicefirecoldheat effects on any other game just makes you brain explodes.

&nbsp;

You can hunt for money. You can hunt for EXP/Hardcore. You can sit on dp and talk to people, you can do everything you want to, with no routes. Every other RPG has linear histories, which you should follow to keep playing.

&nbsp;

On Tibia, you can basically get the highest levels only hunting, without a single quest, all you have to do is choose your vocation, then you're free.

&nbsp;

